OL,3,GNEWSAArson attacks on house and tractor
OL,4,Abelieved to be linked
OL,5,
OL,6,FA house and a tractor were damaged in
OL,7,Ftwo arson attacks in County Armagh on
OL,8,FTuesday evening.
OL,10,FThe Police Service of Northern Ireland
OL,11,F(PSNI) and the Northern Ireland Fire
OL,12,Fand Rescue Service attended a fire at a
OL,13,Fhouse on School Terrace in
OL,14,FNewtownhamilton shortly before
OL,15,Fmidnight.
OL,17,FAt around midnight, a second report was
OL,18,Freceived that a tractor had been set
OL,19,Falight at another property on Tullyneil
OL,20,FRoad.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
